cê é assim também?</p></div></amp-story-grid-layer></amp-story-page><amp-story-page id=\"p5\"><amp-story-grid-layer template=\"fill\" animate-in=\"zoom-out\" animate-in-duration=\"9s\"><amp-img src=\"https://aurenstar.com/stories/img/bg-night.webp\" width=\"720\" height=\"1080\" layout=\"fill\" object-fit=\"cover\" object-position=\"100% 50%\" alt=\"\"></amp-img></amp-story-grid-layer><amp-story-grid-layer template=\"fill\"><div style=\"position:relative;width:100%;height:100%\"><div style=\"position:absolute;left:0.000%;top:0.000%;width:100.000%;height:100.000%;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(0,0,0,0.30) 0%,rgba(0,0,0,0.22) 35%,rgba(0,0,0,0.93) 100%)\"></div><div style=\"position:absolute;left:5.510%;top:3.593%;width:30.000%;height:5.410%\"><amp-img src=\"https://aurenstar.com/stories/img/logo-story.png\" width=\"540\" height=\"173\" layout=\"fill\" object-fit=\"contain\" object-position=\"0% 50%\" alt=\"\"></amp-img></div><div style=\"position:absolute;left:5.825%;top:49.863%;width:33.010%;height:3.825%;background-color:#E73578;border-radius:14px\" animate-in=\"fade-in\" animate-in-delay=\"0.1s\"></div><p style=\"position:absolute;left:5.825%;top:50.683%;width:33.010%;height:2.459%;font-family:Montserrat,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:calc(1.6666666666666667 * var(--story-page-vh));font-weight:800;color:#FFFFFF;line-height:1.3;margin:0;text-shadow:0 1px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.65);text-align:center;text-transform:uppercase\" animate-in=\"fly-in-bottom\" animate-in-delay=\"0.1s\">Motivo final</p><p style=\"position:absolute;left:5.825%;top:55.601%;width:88.350%;height:9.290%;font-family:Montserrat,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:calc(4.242424242424242 * var(--story-page-vh));font-weight:800;color:#FFFFFF;line-height:1.3;margin:0;text-shadow:0 1px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.65)\" animate-in=\"fly-in-bottom\" animate-in-delay=\"0.3s\">E os outros signos?</p><p style=\"position:absolute;left:5.825%;top:66.530%;width:88.350%;hei